# Returns Analysis Dashboard

## Project Overview
This project explores product return behavior using Superstore sales data.  
The interactive Tableau dashboard provides insights into:
- Return rate by product category and sub-category
- Return trends across regions and states
- Customer return patterns
- Seasonal return fluctuations

The goal is to identify root causes of high return rates and support data-driven decisions that improve profitability and customer satisfaction.

